`,(0,n.jsxs)(r.li,{children:[(0,n.jsx)(r.strong,{children:"Connector authentication moment."})," Users who never authenticate a connector get a chat experience, not a Claude Cowork experience. Don't leave this to chance: a 10-min calendar hold on launch day, or have a rotation of teammates available for setup assistance."]}),`
`,(0,n.jsxs)(r.li,{children:[(0,n.jsx)(r.strong,{children:"Side-by-side demo"}),". The champion shows the same task done as a chat prompt vs. a delegated Claude Cowork task with connectors. Same input, different output."]}),`
