`,(0,n.jsx)(r.h3,{id:"phase-2-enablement-connectors-skills-and-real-workflows",children:"Phase 2: Enablement (connectors, skills, and real workflows)"}),`
`,(0,n.jsx)(r.p,{children:"Shift from first success to repeatable competence. Every user gets at least one skill they rely on and at least one plugin installed."}),`
`,(0,n.jsxs)(r.ul,{children:[`
`,(0,n.jsxs)(r.li,{children:[(0,n.jsx)(r.strong,{children:"Skills workshop"}),". The centerpiece of an enablement motion. A hands-on session where every attendee builds at least one skill for their actual work. Champions run one per department during Phases 2–3. See ",(0,n.jsx)(r.a,{href:"https://support.claude.com/en/articles/12512176-what-are-skills",children:"What are Skills?"}),"."]}),`
`,(0,n.jsxs)(r.li,{children:[(0,n.jsx)(r.strong,{children:"Plugin activation push"}),". Users who install a plugin and run its skills early learn Claude Cowork faster. Ensure relevant plugins are available coming out of the Pilot, and include directions on how to use plugins in launch comms. See ",(0,n.jsx)(r.a,{href:"https://support.claude.com/en/articles/13837433-manage-cowork-plugins-for-your-organization",children:"Managing Claude Cowork plugins"}),"."]}),`
`,(0,n.jsxs)(r.li,{children:[(0,n.jsx)(r.strong,{children:"Weekly office hours."})," 30-min drop-in where the champion screen-shares, unblocks stuck users, and demos new skills."]}),`
`,(0,n.jsxs)(r.li,{children:[(0,n.jsx)(r.strong,{children:"Skill of the week"}),". Team posts one skill in the team channel with a short video of it running on real work. Skills provide inspiration for cross-functional teams."]}),`
